# finished: the letter, the wait 1800198000, Prog 1. The Letter from Shikaree Y (a GM). _081's menu closed with no entry
# (finish, no update): no battlefield, nothing. Requiem of Sin's battlefield (678, index 6) entered: Tango's 32000
# finish: not 677, still available; won (bfwin: Requiem's fight ends in an Armoury Crate), 32001: Tango has no 32001
# handler while available (the char stays in the arena after it, so the next menu comes after a zone change). Accepted
# (a GM): the letter held, the wait 0 (a GM): nil, 317; the wait 1800198000 again (a GM), taken away (a GM), the wait =
# the tally: 317; the wait 1800197999 (a GM): 577, finished: the letter, the wait 1800198000; the letter held: 317.
# Three JST days on (the tally 1800802800), the letter taken away: 577, finished: the wait 1800802800. Requiem of Sin's
# battlefield again (the letter Y, a GM), battlefieldWin 678 (a GM, in the arena: Requiem is not accepted, so its own
