mission Cop WhenAngelsFall current
quest OtherAreas.XMarksTheSpot completed
login
trigger Despachiaire                    # 576
finish                                  # the letter; the wait 1800198000; Prog 1
keyitem LetterFromShikareeY             # a GM
warp -617.9,-1.5,505.7 BoneyardGully
